[PrintTextModified Text:熟悉的钟声响起，<br>艾玛等人回到了审判庭。|#0105Adv05_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香的尸体已经像亚里沙一样被处理掉了。|#0105Adv05_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛、可可、玛格、梅露露四人<br>静静地站在证人席前。|#0105Adv05_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:没想到一天之内要进行两次审判呢。|#0105Adv05_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:快点结束吧～，<br>我已经累趴下啦～|#0105Adv05_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

