[PrintTextModified Text:"（没事的，梅露露。<br>　我已经把能做的都做了）|#0105Adv05_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这一定是我最后的审判了）|#0105Adv05_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我一定要找出【魔女】——！）|#0105Adv05_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

